    <briefdescription>
<para>mTLS Connection Factory Interface and Implementation </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>2.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-07-19</para>
</simplesect>
Defines the factory pattern for creating and managing mTLS connections. This interface decouples connection lifecycle management from the pool, enabling dependency injection and testability.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This is part of the v2.0 refactor to move connection ownership into the pool. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
